### create failing-webhook subscription
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "ORDER_SHIPPED",
  "channel": "WEBHOOK",
  "target": "https://httpstat.us/500"
}

> {%  client.global.set("subId", response.body.id); %}

### publish matching event
POST {{baseUrl}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "ORDER_SHIPPED",
  "payload": {"orderId": "123"}
}

### check delivery log
GET {{baseUrl}}/deliveries?subscriptionId={{subId}}